        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/e56c9b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-01-22T05:17:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just managed to unlock Redeemer Fanatic tonight. I used Legacy, Team Leader Tachyon, Visionary, Omnitron-X, and Fanatic. They fought in the Freedom Tower Environment.</p>\n<p>Thanks, all, for the suggestions. I owe my success to&nbsp;this forum community. Mr. Fixer ended up being too effective with Jack Handle and Riveting Crane, which enabled him to kill&nbsp;off Apostate too quickly before Fanatic could get all the requisite cards in play and then deal the final stroke, so I ended up benching him for not being a good team player. ;-)</p>\n<p>Otherwise, yes, he'd normally be awesome and would make a fight against Apostate much easier.</p>\n<p>Prime Warden and Dark Watch unlocks await me further, but for now it's a great sigh of relief I'm feeling. Thank you all, again.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
